      "content": "wait, did you say \"goblin candy\"? i'm a little confused. i'm just trying to understand the legal and financial protections here. can you please stick to the actual professional explanation of how the funds are secured? i'm really stressed about this house and i just need clear, standard information without the metaphors.",
